    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For generations, this land has whispered a strange legend:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;On nights when the mist falls, never walk outside. If shadows begin to sway, shut your doors immediately.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the mist blankets the town, yokai emerge from nowhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They follow the scent of human presence\u2014 <br>and once they find you, they show no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ayase Izumi, Mio Gionji, Kyosuke Mochizuki, and Aki Naruse were all looking forward to their summer vacation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But on the night before their break began, the town was swallowed by mist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>RINNE TENJOU</i></strong> is a 2D adventure\u00a0 Action game that weaves together the intertwined memories of four boys and girls, their confrontation with the past, and the bonds they forge with one another\u2014all set in a town consumed by mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two main modes: <br><strong>Adventure Mode</strong> and <strong>Action Mode</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the prologue\u2014what happened before the mist consumed the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630100/extras/209e15aa22b6ada2d34651aa1c6967f9.poster.avif?t=1747965294\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630100/extras/209e15aa22b6ada2d34651aa1c6967f9.webm?t=1747965294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630100/extras/209e15aa22b6ada2d34651aa1c6967f9.mp4?t=1747965294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious underground world and unravel the hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630100/extras/7febb18bb4c4b111f980e46615a43ca5.poster.avif?t=1747965294\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630100/extras/7febb18bb4c4b111f980e46615a43ca5.webm?t=1747965294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630100/extras/7febb18bb4c4b111f980e46615a43ca5.mp4?t=1747965294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For generations, this land has whispered a strange legend:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;On nights when the mist falls, never walk outside. If shadows begin to sway, shut your doors immediately.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the mist blankets the town, yokai emerge from nowhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They follow the scent of human presence\u2014 <br>and once they find you, they show no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ayase Izumi, Mio Gionji, Kyosuke Mochizuki, and Aki Naruse were all looking forward to their summer vacation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But on the night before their break began, the town was swallowed by mist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>RINNE TENJOU</i></strong> is a 2D adventure\u00a0 Action game that weaves together the intertwined memories of four boys and girls, their confrontation with the past, and the bonds they forge with one another\u2014all set in a town consumed by mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two main modes: <br><strong>Adventure Mode</strong> and <strong>Action Mode</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the prologue\u2014what happened before the mist consumed the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630100/extras/209e15aa22b6ada2d34651aa1c6967f9.poster.avif?t=1747965294\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630100/extras/209e15aa22b6ada2d34651aa1c6967f9.webm?t=1747965294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630100/extras/209e15aa22b6ada2d34651aa1c6967f9.mp4?t=1747965294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious underground world and unravel the hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630100/extras/7febb18bb4c4b111f980e46615a43ca5.poster.avif?t=1747965294\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630100/extras/7febb18bb4c4b111f980e46615a43ca5.webm?t=1747965294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630100/extras/7febb18bb4c4b111f980e46615a43ca5.mp4?t=1747965294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
